IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `je54-nouns`
IMPORT `je54-vintage`
IMPORT `je54-art09-10-references`

-- je54-tests-art09-10-references: Articles 9 and 10.  Expected values were written from the text of the Articles in each of the seven deposited versions before this module was run.
-- Article 9(3) is the only paragraph of Articles 9 and 10 that differs between versions: V1 says "as amended from time to time"; from V2a it says "as amended, revised or otherwise consolidated (within the meaning of
-- the Legislation (Jersey) Law 2021) from time to time".  The same scenario is put to every text.
-- The instruments named below are made up for the test (the Sample (Jersey) Law 2020 and its Regulations): they are not real enactments.

`text V1` MEANS `V1, 1 January 2019 to 27 September 2021`
`text V2a` MEANS `V2a, 28 September 2021 to 30 January 2022`
`text V2b` MEANS `V2b, 31 January 2022 to 31 August 2022`
`text V2c` MEANS `V2c, 1 September 2022 to 10 January 2024`
`text V2d` MEANS `V2d, 11 January 2024 to 23 November 2025`
`text V2e` MEANS `V2e, 24 November 2025 to 18 June 2026`
`text V2f` MEANS `V2f, 19 June 2026 to current`
`text inferred` MEANS `the inferred text from 28 March 2003 to 31 December 2018`
`text none` MEANS `no text before 28 March 2003`

`a Law` MEANS `a Law passed by the States and confirmed in Council`
`regulations under the authority of an Order in Council` MEANS `regulations, an Order, rules, bye-laws, a scheme or other instrument passed or made in Jersey under the authority of an Order in Council`
`regulations under a Law` MEANS `regulations, an Order, rules, bye-laws, a scheme or other instrument passed or made in Jersey under a Law passed by the States and confirmed in Council`

GIVEN kind IS A `Kind of division referred to`
      number IS A STRING
      further IS A BOOLEAN
      instrument IS A `Kind of instrument`
GIVETH A `Reference by number or letter`
`a reference in the Sample Law or its Regulations to` kind number further instrument MEANS
    `Reference by number or letter` WITH
        `the kind of division named` IS kind
        `the number or letter given` IS number
        `further identification is given` IS further
        `the kind of instrument that contains the reference` IS instrument
        `the instrument that contains the reference` IS "the Sample (Jersey) Law 2020"
        `the division that contains the reference` IS "Article 5"

§ `Article 9(1): a Part, Article or Schedule by number only is the one of that number in that Law`

#ASSERT (`Article 9(1) and 9(2): the place that a reference by number or letter alone leads to` `text V1` (`a reference in the Sample Law or its Regulations to` `an Article` "3" FALSE `a Law`))'s `the place it is in` EQUALS "the Sample (Jersey) Law 2020"
#ASSERT (`Article 9(1) and 9(2): the place that a reference by number or letter alone leads to` `text V2a` (`a reference in the Sample Law or its Regulations to` `an Article` "3" FALSE `a Law`))'s `the place it is in` EQUALS "the Sample (Jersey) Law 2020"
