#ASSERT (`Article 9(1) and 9(2): the place that a reference by number or letter alone leads to` `text V2d` (`a reference in the Sample Law or its Regulations to` `an Article` "3" FALSE `a Law`))'s `the number or letter` EQUALS "3"
