#ASSERT `Article 9(3): a reference to an enactment is a reference to it in the form` `text V2e` `the enactment as extended or applied under another enactment` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 9(3): a reference to an enactment is a reference to it in the form` `text V2f` `the enactment as extended or applied under another enactment` FALSE
