#ASSERT `Article 9(3): a reference to an enactment is a reference to it in the form` `text V2a` `the enactment as extended or applied under another provision of the same Law` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 9(3): a reference to an enactment is a reference to it in the form` `text V2b` `the enactment as extended or applied under another provision of the same Law` FALSE
